#: field:field_system_report:work_report:description
msgctxt "field_system_report:work_report:description"
msgid ""
"Some reports are created by the system on behalf of the users. For example "
"when an user registers in the portal, or when a report is submitted by a "
"regular user. Account creation as well as report preparation/writing take "
"time and these activities should be rewarded. Rovas therefore automatically "
"creates \"system\" reports and immediately issues rewards for these "
"activities. System reports must not be rewarded and this flag caries "
"information that prevents the system from creating a system report of a "
"system report, in order to avoid an infinite regress."
msgstr ""

